                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Before purchasing, just remember: This was the first game in a line of many, it was the stepping stone from which Transport Fever 1, 2 and 3 stood upon and started the way. \n\n- If you want to buy it as a legacy product, you're welcome to do so, but don't expect it to be better than the sequels. \n- If you already have it, enjoy it. If you find it on sale and just want to see how it all started, do it. \n- If you want a polished game, just skip this one and go for TF1-2-3. Each one is better than the last one.\n\nFor all of those who give it a thumbs down because they dont like the old mechanics, i would suggest you don´t.",
